WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:11.043
In tutorial 11.7, you'll give
each client its own workspace,

00:00:11.093 --> 00:00:13.271
and decide which of
your people work on it.

00:00:14.291 --> 00:00:18.516
First, if your company isn't an
agency yet, open Company settings,

00:00:18.566 --> 00:00:21.086
and under Agency mode, click Learn more.

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:26.727
Then click Turn on agency mode. Only
the owner of the company can do this.

00:00:28.095 --> 00:00:32.510
Now, on Clients, click New client.
Type the client's name and website,

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:34.026
and click Create client.

00:00:35.549 --> 00:00:40.179
Each client gets its own workspace, with
its own websites, credits and people,

00:00:40.229 --> 00:00:42.156
listed under Client workspaces.

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:46.115
Next, click Team access beside a client.

00:00:46.165 --> 00:00:49.739
Owners and admins of your
agency reach every client.

00:00:50.713 --> 00:00:54.113
For each member or viewer,
choose No access, Viewer,

00:00:54.163 --> 00:00:57.034
Member or Admin for this
client, and click Done.

00:00:57.997 --> 00:01:03.142
Back on Clients, one table shows every
client website, with its health, rankings,

00:01:03.192 --> 00:01:06.303
clicks, AI visibility, alerts and credits.

00:01:07.303 --> 00:01:09.778
The tiles add them up across clients.

00:01:09.828 --> 00:01:13.244
Click Export CSV to take
the whole table with you.

00:01:14.249 --> 00:01:18.324
To work on a client, click its
name. Its own workspace opens,

00:01:18.374 --> 00:01:20.485
marked as a client of your agency.

00:01:21.439 --> 00:01:25.798
To go back, open the company menu
at the top, and choose all clients.

00:01:27.464 --> 00:01:30.214
Now every client has its own workspace,

00:01:30.264 --> 00:01:33.398
and each of your people works
only on the clients you give them.

00:01:34.428 --> 00:01:39.593
So, turn on agency mode, create a client
workspace, give your people access,

00:01:39.643 --> 00:01:42.722
see every client in one table,
and switch between them.

00:01:43.752 --> 00:01:48.527
All your clients, in one place. Next,
brand the client portal as your own,

00:01:48.577 --> 00:01:50.597
in tutorial 11.8.
